From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bryan Hoban <bryan.hoban@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 13:11:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] RPi5: kodi: stereoscopic 3D playback

Dom Cobley's stereoscopic 3D series for the GBM / DRM PRIME path
(popcornmix/xbmc fix-stereoscopic-3d-gbm-upstream), on top of the Dolby
Vision patches: HDMI frame-packed, side-by-side and top-and-bottom 3D
modes with an eye per video plane, H.264 MVC and MV-HEVC decoding to two
views, Blu-ray 3D playback, and 3D subtitles at the disc's depth.

Signed-off-by: Bryan Hoban <bryan.hoban@gmail.com>
