+Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 10:56:31 +0100
+Subject: [PATCH 45/46] [VideoPlayer] Keep Blu-ray 3D subtitle depth across
+ play items
+
+Subtitles went flat from the moment the demuxer reached the next play
+item until playback reached the one after it: the 3D demuxer emptied
+the offset store whenever it reopened the dependent view, about 16 s
+before the old item had finished showing, and the lookup added the
+current timestamp correction, which already belonged to the new clip.
+
+Keep the store across clip changes (a seek still flushes it) and give
+each block the correction of the clip it came from.
+
