+ layout without an mvcC box
+
+mkvmerge remuxes of MakeMKV/tsMuxer MVC rips keep StereoMode block_lr and the
+dependent view's subset SPS and slices in band, but drop the mvcC box from
+CodecPrivate. The stream was then decoded as 2D.
